# Taiwan
# Source: https://mcc-mnc.org/countries/taiwan
# Coverage mode: all observed carrier rows grouped by MCC/MNC
# 3GPP domain pattern: ims.mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.3gppnetwork.org
# 3GPP pub domain pattern: epdg.epc.mnc<MNC>.mcc<MCC>.pub.3gppnetwork.org

# Real-IP fallback for IKEv2/IPsec Wi-Fi Calling (UDP has no SNI/Host)
AND,((PROTOCOL,UDP),(DEST-PORT,500),(GEOIP,TW))
AND,((PROTOCOL,UDP),(DEST-PORT,4500),(GEOIP,TW))

